Re-encrypts stored secrets under the newest key in the keys variable, so older keys can be retired

Usage: leptoskit auth rotate-keys [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --url <URL>  The database URL; defaults to the variable `db.url_env` names
  -h, --help       Print help
  -V, --version    Print version
